00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:21.760
So it's important for you to self assess and get really honest with yourself and give yourself

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:26.960
feedback in areas that you need improvement. So after every single coaching session, what I do is

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:31.920
I have a little notebook beside me and I write down everything that I can improve on. And from

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:36.800
there, I'll do additional research and brainstorm different ideas to make it better. So one of the

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:42.400
things that I was working on that I was frustrated about was a beginning exercise of my coaching

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:50.400
sessions. So I do an exercise to set the intention for every single session. And that intention is to

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:57.120
be radically honest, both coming from me and from the client. And the reason why it's important

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:03.440
is because I want to get people results quickly, because they only have 45 minutes with me and I

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:10.720
want to make sure I get them as far as I can. And I cannot do that if people are dancing around the

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:17.280
truth. I need to get to the truth right away. And honestly, it's not because people don't want to

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:22.880
be honest with me. And it's not because people are lying to me. A lot of that comes from them

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:28.720
being afraid of judgment of me. You know, they're afraid that if they say something to me, I might

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:34.560
judge them for it. So I have done a bunch of different exercises before. I have done a dancing

