exercise. I have done a singing exercise. And most recently, I've been doing a meditation exercise,

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:45.920
which has been good. It relaxes the people. It kind of brings them in focus and they're present.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:53.040
But I'm still not seeing the truth right away. It still takes me about half an hour to get to the

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:59.840
truth. And honestly, we don't have half an hour to get to the truth. We need to get solutions right

