00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:05.440
feedback like that is for two reasons. The first thing is that no matter how much self-awareness

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:11.040
you have, you're still going to have some blind spots and it's impossible for you to work on

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:16.640
things that you just simply cannot see. So having that person seeing the things that you can't see,

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:24.240
you could find ways to actually get better in those areas. And the second part is you're not

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:32.640
always going to have the answers and that's okay. So having someone who again has been through the

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:38.480
process before, who has more experience than you, could help you get some of those answers that

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:44.640
you're looking for and help you get unstuck. So having someone that will give you feedback,

